==Battleground==
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lucky Sloth]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**2 [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**1 [[Dagshund]] spawns.
**3 [[Lucky Dags]] spawn, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] outranges all the enemies in this level, so take advantage of that and stack him with some proper meatshielding to easily beat this level.

